{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月3日 \" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261103.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】本台早前揭發有「白牌車」接載內地旅客離港，警方連日發起打擊及拘捕行動。究竟跨境「白牌車」為何禁之不絕？怎樣才是長遠的治本方案？</p><p>周二《時事全方位》，請來嘉賓討論。</p><p>題目：跨境白牌車問題</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:03:34.037969+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:55:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:02:13.221671+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:00:06.692352+00:00","content_hash":"ec5d9073b87d676b98fc9e4fe8523e4937334724ade5874a708c559156ba3b9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:03:34.037969+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}